From: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] media: Add LT8619C and D1/T113 CSIC capture

Port Rockchip's LT8619C setup and timing detection to the generic subdev
API. Use single-channel SDR BT.656 on D8-D15. Add EDID, stream control
and bounded lock/phase checks.

Backport Nguyen Minh Tien's D1/T113 CSIC driver and SoC node to
Linux 6.18.64, configure embedded sync and handle source unbind.

Link: https://lore.kernel.org/linux-media/20260930154835.402684-3-tien.nguyenminh@embeddedlinux.blog/
Link: https://github.com/rockchip-linux/kernel/blob/develop-6.1/drivers/media/i2c/lt8619c.c
Signed-off-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
